  "details": "This is an issue that only started happening with the big controls overhaul update.\n\nIn-game keyboard unresponsive in VR. Most notably the left hand seems to not register keyboard button presses 99% of the time after using the right-hand controller to press a key. You have to press a key twice before it registers (if it doesn't detect the key the first time it will always go through on the second press). I suspect this may be related to the haptic feedback issue that I reported a few moments ago, as both issued started happening at the same time. This makes typing unbearable and some game worlds (like draw detective) completely unplayable in VR because you take 10x longer to type anything due to half your key presses not going through.",
